er-Dog must convince a rag-tag shelter pack - Ace the hound, PB the potbellied pig, Merton the turtle and Chip the squirrel - to master their own newfound powers and help him rescue the superheroes.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":71689,\"title\":\"Phineas and Ferb the Movie: Across the 2nd Dimension\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/updMFSOZwEftfkJRpozwBlRlYI2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uxezSInaPoH20CyHx4TuY1LzGly.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Phineas and Ferb get trapped in an alternate dimension where the evil Doofenshmirtz rules the tri-state area. They must find a way back home with the help of their pet platypus named Perry, who they discover is a secret agent.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12610,\"title\":\"Osmosis Jones\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/foZpSG88IQUCEBJE3unc5QzO6bQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b4bOy4QfEN9DfWrH2iTVi2W9eOp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A white blood cell policeman, with the help of a cold pill, must stop a deadly virus from destroying the human they live in, Frank.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16187,\"title\":\"Buzz Lightyear of Star Command: The Adventure Begins\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sbZ2ETj55ZpumplROESuWCLV3q7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2r6tLi4p21dqVmOP5Lwge4hcDAU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Buzz Lightyear must battle Emperor Zurg with the help of three hopefuls who insist on being his partners.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":581997,\"title\":\"Batman vs Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yP3h0Pu8htyb9450mWJ9Vu1rU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sA50fD5aLbYPRU0fMCHIZ88gc5g.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Batman, Batgirl, and Robin forge an alliance with the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles to fight against the Turtles' sworn enemy, The Shredder, who has apparently teamed up with Ra's Al Ghul and The League of Assassins.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":523777,\"title\":\"Next Gen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hUDDo5MPWM6rc6COQYhaoRNqvhE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iohOuTT3OAuvzkiNPFSL7fUWhD6.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A friendship with a top-secret robot turns a lonely girl's life into a thrilling adventure as they take on bullies, evil bots and a scheming madman.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20771,\"title\":\"Kim Possible Movie: So the Drama\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rQ5WS0zWDRau2lI0FYpGYDGmDVS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y8n9w26LU9BYiMIyARv6dbg6NO8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Drakken has an evil new plot for world domination, but his ultimate success depends upon finding out KP's weakness which may involve a new hottie at Middleton High School named Eric, who suddenly sparks feelings in Ron about Kim that resemble much more than friendship. To make matters worse, Bueno Nacho, Ron's favorite fast food chain has turned sour on him by bombarding him with little Devils.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":491633,\"title\":\"Marvel Rising: Secret Warriors\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rXmc4jvDBU04Wp8r5JMWy3HbhB3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iVAzSEm2ERu080VN2fWQG27NkdR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a threat no one could have expected bears down on the Marvel Universe, this ragtag, untrained band of teens have no choice but to rise together and prove to the world that sometimes the difference between a 'hero' and 'misfit' is just in the name.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Animation\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13253,\"title\":\"Futurama: Bender's Game\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bx8OVOBn5WP9TJJuOpRzyMCdzzb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uZzVtRO2aV9gtFx9WHNZ2nR9z55.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Leela is insulted by a group of space-rednecks (like regular rednecks, but in space), she enters the Planet Express ship in a demolition derby. Leela emerges victorious, but when she brings the damaged ship home, and the Professor sees the fuel gauge, he's enraged by the hit he's going to take at the Dark Matter pump.  Now the crew have to find a way to break Mom's stranglehold on starship fuel, even if they have to wade through a Lord of the Rings-inspired fantasy-land to do it!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"LNXDORibqkE\",\"name\":\"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles | Original Titelsong | Nickelodeon Deutschland\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}